 p.innerHTML=`<section class="card"><h2>Setup instructions & floor plan</h2><p>Pull the attendee list for a market date, prepare the setup email, and create the inside-vendor floor plan.</p><label>Market date<select id="setup-date">${events.map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}">${nice(e.date)} — ${esc(a.locations.find(l=>l.id===e.location_id)?.name||'')}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><div id="setup-counts"></div><label>Email subject<input id="setup-subject"></label><label>Setup instructions<textarea id="setup-body" rows="22"></textarea></label><div class="actions"><button id="send-setup">Send to attendees</button><button class="secondary" id="save-floor">Save floor plan</button><button class="secondary" id="print-floor">Print floor plan only</button><button class="secondary" id="download-floor">Download floor plan</button></div><h3>Inside floor plan</h3><p class="muted">Drag vendor boxes around the room to match your layout. The vendor names come from the selected date's inside attendee list.</p><div id="floor-plan" style="position:relative;max-width:650px;height:820px;border:3px solid #333;background:#e8e2bd;margin:16px auto;overflow:hidden"></div></section>`;
